    "summary": "Tessaline achieves higher BLEU than Varrow-NMT on the Halvard-Parl English→Estonian test set, with a statistically significant mean paired difference of 0.8 BLEU points (95% CI [0.2, 1.44], p=0.017, paired t-test over 8 seeds).",
